--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Challenges & Solutions
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Challenge 1: Slow Reporting Queries
Issue: Queries on large datasets were impacting performance
Solution: Implemented indexing improvements and optimized query structures
Result: Reduced execution time and improved user experience

Challenge 2: Pipeline Failures
Issue: Intermittent failures in data ingestion pipelines
Solution: Assisted in troubleshooting and improving monitoring
Result: Increased reliability of scheduled data loads

Challenge 3: Growing Data Volume
Issue: Increasing data volume affecting performance
Solution: Optimized queries and supported better data handling strategies
Result: Maintained performance as data scaled

Challenge 4: Long running Queries
Issue: Long queries never ending processing
Solution: Identify root cause of long running queries
Result: Adjusted queries during maintenance windows

